{'symbol': 'PWR', 'date': '2022-05-27 16:05:00', 'title': 'QUANTA SERVICES ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'HOUSTON , MAY 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUANTA SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: PWR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND TO STOCKHOLDERS OF $0.07 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JULY 15, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JULY 1, 2022.'}